        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jon Hamm, Don Draper, Don, Betty, January Jones\n- Works: Mad Men\n- Roles: actor, director, television producer, advertising executive\n- Topics: family life, romantic life, public relations\n\nFacts:\n- Jonathan Daniel Hamm was born on March 10, 1971.\n- Jon Hamm is an American actor, director, and television producer.\n- Jon Hamm is best known for playing advertising executive Don Draper in the AMC drama series Mad Men, which ran from 2007 to 2015.\n- In Mad Men, Don's ex-wife Betty, played by January Jones, struggles to fit in with her new family.\n- In Mad Men, Don encounters problems in his romantic life.",
